ide you."},{"npc":"Dleria Mausrel","text":"Peeuww!! That most certainly is zombie flesh!! Here is your reward. You have done a fine service in the name of Prexus. Soon you shall advance and we may tell you of greater dangers lurking in the depths."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-16T08:03:59.165Z","outOfEra":false}
