Gathering Grain	25	{"kind":"quest","title":"Gathering Grain","wikiPath":"/Gathering_Grain","sources":[{"kind":"quest","where":"Western Plains of Karana","detail":"Start zone"},{"kind":"quest","where":"Henina Miller","detail":"Quest giver"}],"components":[],"rewards":[{"text":"Faction, Small Coin, Experience"}],"card":{"title":"Gathering Grain","lines":["Minimum Level: 1","Classes: All","Related Zones: None","Related NPCs: None","Faction note: Henina Miller may be found at -2855, -5840. Dubious faction is sufficient to complete the quest. A Troll Shaman of Cazic-thule is able to complete it."]},"links":["Western Plains of Karana","Henina Miller","Faction","Cleet Miller","Sack of Hay","Scarecrow","Tiny","Karana Residents","Guards of Qeynos","Priests of Life","Knights of Thunder"],"dialogue":[{"npc":"Henina Miller","text":"Greetings, ______. Welcome to the Miller Farmstead. [Cleet] and I have lived out here on the plains of Karana for thirty years now. We grow the finest grains in all of Norrath. Admire the grains all you like, but steer clear of those [scarecrows]."},{"npc":"Henina Miller","text":"Yep, those scarecrows are snarky. I've told Cleet more than a few times that I'd like to cook their heads into a pie, but he won't let me get near them. Oh, there was a recipe book that the Hutchison's gave us as a gift that described how to bake five different wisp lightstones into a scarecrow head to make it glow. Ah well."},{"npc":"Henina Miller","text":"Cleet is my husband. He is a hard worker and provides for the kids and me."}],"fetchedAt":"2026-09-23T06:26:30.621Z","outOfEra":false}
